<title>INDIA: Indian February fertiliser output falls.</title>
<headline>Indian February fertiliser output falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's fertiliser production fell in February compared with the same month last year, the government said on Friday.</p>
<p>    FERTILISER OUTPUT  Feb 1997    Feb 1996   April-February</p>
<p>							    1996/97 1995/96</p>
<p>    Nitrogenous	    741.1	 751.7    7,756.7  8,003.5</p>
<p>    Phosphatic	     197.0	 209.1    2,333.7  2,324.1</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and preliminary.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
